OL,3,ASpain announces ban on evictions after
OL,4,Aprotests over 87-year-old woman's
OL,5,Aeviction
OL,6,
OL,7,FSpain's coalition government has
OL,8,Fapproved new housing measures following
OL,9,Fprotests over the country's housing
OL,10,Fcrisis, sparked by the eviction of an
OL,11,F87-year-old woman from her home in
OL,12,FMadrid last week.
OL,14,FMinisters met on Tuesday to discuss the
OL,15,Fproposals, which include a ban on
OL,16,Fevictions until 2030.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
