OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ASpain announces ban on evictions after
OL,4,Aprotests over 87-year-old woman's
OL,5,Aeviction
OL,6,
OL,7,FAnnouncing the measures, Health
OL,8,FMinister Monica Garcia said they would
OL,9,Fbring relief to more than five million
OL,10,Fpeople - but opposition politician
OL,11,FMiriam Nogueras said the agreement left
OL,12,F"small landlords out in the cold".
OL,14,FThe proposals - which have been
OL,15,Fpresented in the form of two decrees -
OL,16,Fcome into effect immediately, but must
OL,17,Fbe approved by Congress within a month,
OL,18,Falthough the government hopes to hold
OL,19,Fthe vote as soon as this Friday.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
